[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     7[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### A. Runtime options / modes
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     8[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     9[0m:[38;5;10m[49m This library exposes **no** setter, flag, mode or `#ifdef`. The only
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m "configuration" state is the three file-scope `static`s, which are never
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m written after initialisation:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | state | value | effect |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m |-------|-------|--------|
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `static_multiplier`   | `3`   | `multiply_with_static`: `(a*b)*3` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `static_addend`       | `100` | `add_with_static`: `(a+b)+100` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `static_shift_amount` | `2`   | `shift_with_static`: `(a<<2)|(b>>2)` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `ops[4]` (function-`static` in `get_operation`) | lazily filled on first call | first-call vs. subsequent-call path (`if (ops[0] == NULL)`) |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The *selectable* mode is therefore the `opcode` dispatch in `get_operation`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m (0=multiply, 1=add, 2=xor, 3=shift) and which function pointer a caller hands
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m to `execute_operation` / `apply_operation`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### B. Input shapes the code special-cases
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
