[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * signed-arithmetic shapes: zero, positive, negative, `INT_MAX`, `INT_MIN`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   values that wrap on `*`, `+`, and `<<`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `shift_with_static`: sign bit shifted out of `a<<2`; arithmetic (sign
