[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   promotion), little-endian byte order of `int`, all-zero, all-`0xFF`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `ComputeState` shapes: fresh vs. already-populated struct, repeated
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `apply_operation` calls (`operation_count` accumulation), `checksum` field
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    37[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   untouched by `apply_operation`.
